### Claude Code live settings ###
# Claude Code writes machine-gathered data into this file by itself — autoMode
# records the current repo's org, protected branches and CI secret names. This
# repo is public, so only the sanitised sample is tracked; setup-links.bash
# seeds the real file from it on a fresh machine.
